OL,3,GNEWSAPassengers hope for better bus
OL,4,Ashelters by winter
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents in Eastbourne say they hope
OL,7,Fupgraded bus shelters will be installed
OL,8,Fbefore the winter, after the old
OL,9,Fshelters were removed.
OL,11,FLewes and Eastbourne Councils announced
OL,12,F164 new shelters in April, with removal
OL,13,Fand more modern shelters to be
OL,14,Finstalled across the district and in
OL,15,FEastbourne.
OL,17,FEastbourne Borough Council (EBC)
OL,18,Fapologised for the delay which it said
OL,19,Fwas due to a delay in the contractor's
OL,20,Fmanufacturing process.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
