OL,3,GNEWSAPassengers hope for better bus
OL,4,Ashelters by winter
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson said new bus shelters
OL,7,Fare now being installed across the East
OL,8,FSussex town, with "multiple
OL,9,Finstallations scheduled each week"
OL,10,Fwhich will "continue to gather pace
OL,11,Fover the coming weeks".
